### CREATE BONUS
POST http://localhost:8084/bonuses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Welcome Bonus",
  "description": "100% match bonus",
  "wageringRequirement": 1000
}

###

### LIST BONUSES
GET http://localhost:8084/bonuses

###

### GET BONUS (adjust id if needed)
GET http://localhost:8084/bonuses/bonus-3

###

### GRANT FREE SPIN
POST http://localhost:8084/bonuses/players/player-1/grant-free-spin

###

### CHECK ACTIVE BONUS
GET http://localhost:8084/bonuses/players/player-1/has-active-bonus

###

### CONSUME FREE SPIN
POST http://localhost:8084/bonuses/players/player-1/consume

###

### VERIFY AFTER CONSUME
GET http://localhost:8084/bonuses/players/player-1/has-active-bonus